','2026-08-25 05:31:01'),(1600,'247236185338020','incoming','Is this available ?',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 05:31:33'),(1601,'247236185338020','incoming','And pp',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 05:31:45'),(1602,'247236185338020','incoming','📷 Photo','/uploads/whatsapp_media/media-247236185338020-1787635917478.jpg','image','customer','2026-08-25 05:31:57'),(1603,'68316387348606','incoming','*Excavator / JCB Lever gana* kiyannam 👇\n\nRomania interview eke ahuwe wadi wenama me lever 2 gana. Ewa hariyata danagattoth 80% win 💪\n\n### *Excavator eke thiyena Main Levers 2*\n\nExcavator wala godak welawata *2 Joystick System* ekak thiyenne. Eka thama *SAE Controls* kiyanne.\n\n#### *1. Left Lever / Left Joystick*\nMeka wenas wenawa wada 2k karanawa:\n\n1. *Iwata / Pawata thalloth* = *Boom Up / Down*  \n   Iwata = Boom Uda, Pawata = Boom Paata\n2. *Dekata / Wamata hirikoth* = *Swing*  \n   Dekata = Cab eka Dekata spin, Wamata = Cab eka Wamata spin\n\n#### *2. Right Lever / Right Joystick*\nMeeth wada 2k:\n\n1. *Iwata / Pawata thalloth* = *Arm In / Out*  \n   Iwata = Arm ඇතුලට, Pawata = Arm එලියට\n2. *Dekata / Wamata hirikoth* = *Bucket Open / Close*  \n   Dekata = Bucket Open, Wamata = Bucket Close\n\n### *Wena Controls*\nControl	Wada\n**Track Levers 2**	Kawata wamata yawanna. Dekkama iwata = Inna. Dekkama pawata = Paata\n**Accelerator**	RPM wadhi karanna. Wada karaddi 70% wage thiyaganna\n**Horn + Lights**	Site eke signal denna\n**Dozer Blade Lever**	JCB walata thiyenne. Paadama level karanna\n### *Mata asaama Tips - Beginner kenekta*\n\n1. *\"WATA BATA\" rule*  \n   WATA = *W*rist *A*rm *T*rack *A*rm  \n   BATA = *B*ucket *A*rm *T*rack *A*rm  \n   Me rule eken control akaatha naa\n\n2. *Slow & Smooth*  \n   Levers tikak tikak halla. Ekai ekai weda karanna. Dekak ekka karoth confuse wenawa\n\n3. *Safety First*  \n   Weda karanna kalin aye balanna. Blind spot ekak nathnam horn gahanna\n\n4. *Practice*  \n   YouTube > \"excavator controls simulator\" kiyala hoyanna. Game eken atha purudu karaganna\n\n### *JCB 3DX vs Excavator wenas*\n- *JCB*: Ithin lever 4-5k thiyenawa. Gear, Loader bucket lever, Backhoe lever aluth\n- *Excavator*: Wadiwagema Joystick 2i. Eka thamai easy\n\n### *Interview eke ahuwe puluwan prashna*\n\"Left lever eka iwata kale mokak wenne?\"  \n\"Bucket close karanna kohomada?\"  \n\"Machine eka spin karanna kohomada?\"\n\nUthare: Left iwata = Boom Up. Right dekata = Bucket Open. Left wamata = Swing wamata\n\n---\n\nOya meka balanna YouTube eke: *\"Excavator Controls Explained for Beginners\"*  \nSimulator app ekenath atha purudu wenawa.\n\nMata video ekak yawanna da? nathnam diagram ekak hadala denna da?  \nNathnam oya specific JCB model ekak gana da ahanne? ❤️     mokkd me iwata dekata gaga thiyenne piliwelt කියන්න',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 05:36:58'),(1604,'68316387348606','incoming','',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 05:37:05'),(1605,'206305063133385','incoming','Crop top price','/uploads/whatsapp_media/media-206305063133385-1787636670533.jpg','image','customer','2026-08-25 05:44:30'),(1606,'209594437619947','incoming','Crop top available','/uploads/whatsapp_media/media-209594437619947-1787636877643.jpg','image','customer','2026-08-25 05:47:57'),(1607,'64493799375069','incoming','Hi',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 05:53:36'),(1608,'64493799375069','incoming','How much is this','/uploads/whatsapp_media/media-64493799375069-1787637227871.jpg','image','customer','2026-08-25 05:53:47'),(1609,'242395841073318','incoming','Meke prise ek','/uploads/whatsapp_media/media-242395841073318-1787637612699.jpg','image','customer','2026-08-25 06:00:12'),(1610,'242395841073318','incoming','Cash on delivery thiyede',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 06:00:41'),(1611,'254082312835199','incoming','Price','/uploads/whatsapp_media/media-254082312835199-1787638576447.jpg','image','customer','2026-08-25 06:16:16'),(1612,'167989659889698','incoming','',NULL,NULL,'customer','2026-08-25 06:18:49'),(1613,'268457803288736','i